OL,3,GNEWSAMemories of a world sailing
OL,4,Aadventure 50 years ago
OL,5,
OL,6,FA carpenter who sailed 20,000 miles
OL,7,Faround the world has recalled how armed
OL,8,Fsoldiers boarded his yacht and he came
OL,9,Fface-to-face with a whale during an
OL,10,Fadventure that changed his life.
OL,12,F"We got detained three times by the
OL,13,Flocal authorities," says 79-year-old
OL,14,FColin Foskett, from Fareham.
OL,16,F"Once in Cape Verde, once in
OL,17,FMontevideo, and once in Punta Arenas.
OL,19,F"These big soldiers came on board with
OL,20,Ftheir hobnail boots and their guns to
OL,21,Ftell us 'this is the wrong flag'."
